      "writtenOn": "2018-02-14T16:22:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is going to be error-prone. This method was intended to set all the capabilities in one go. So it should at least clear all the unwanted capabilities. Better yet, it should take two arrays instead of one, one for the wanted list and one for the unwanted list.\n\nI don\u0027t think this method has many (or even any?) callers, so it shouldn\u0027t be hard to fix.",
      "range": {
